  <item>
    <title>vol.17 《流年忆昔》：用“儒道互补”的精神豁达地生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f9e357e05c0efcd6e9bd3b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69f9e357e05c0efcd6e9bd3b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 May 2026 12:45:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你好呀，欢迎打开shownote.本期分享的是汪曾祺的散文集《流年忆昔》。闲暇时光读一下，跟着汪老一起在回忆里漫游。 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 和老师交换读书，慢悠悠地读，慢悠悠地分享:</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a>   汪曾祺老师的简介</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="289">04:49</a>  细节描写：压倒草叶的小孩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="439">07:19</a>  小幽默1：闻一多先生的衣服</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">08:55</a> 小幽默2：祖父最喜爱的小孩儿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">10:14</a> 联大岁月</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="683">11:23</a> 跑警报</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="711">11:51</a> 段子导入</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> “跑警报”说法的来历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="857">14:17</a> 三种警报简介</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 跑警报地点1：马尾松林。战时小吃街。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a> 跑警报地点2：横断沟。战时艺术馆。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1172">19:32</a> 三种警报详细介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1258">20:58</a> 跑警报人剪影:：边逃命边谈恋爱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> 世外高人：不跑警报人剪影</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">24:44</a> “不在乎”的精神，永远不被征服</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1537">25:37</a> 我的感悟：淡淡地活出最顽强的生命力。一切困难都会过去的。</span></p><p><span>本期BGM：</span></p><p><span>毛不易——《小王》</span></p><p><span>Lester Garcia——《Sublime Gracia》</span></p>]]></description>
