  <item>
    <title>vol.16 《与病对话-全科医生诊疗手册》：一切顺其自然，一切恰到好处。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69251da8e09dc0297abcd05c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69251da8e09dc0297abcd05c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Nov 2025 03:10:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你好呀，欢迎打开shownotes。好久不见，你最近看了什么新书呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我分享的书是《与病对话：全科医生诊疗手册》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> 开头：分享一首歌《这条小鱼在乎》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">2:40</a> 全书概括，整体的感想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">4:22</a> 黄原教授的故事：“糊涂疗法”，乐观豁达地接受自己身体的任何状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">9:56</a> 蛇缠腰的“拉奥孔”婆婆的故事：有人希望你好，你就会好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> 张春的故事：“丢了魂儿没事啊，有亲妈在啥都好说。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1028">17:08</a> 洛夏医生的故事：“那是因为主的缘故。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a> 中里巴人《求医不如求己》：“活出您的荣耀来。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> 结尾：一切顺其自然，一切恰到好处。</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到的播客：《张春酷酷酷》链接：<a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6487055d6752b5f9de8d8078" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6487055d6752b5f9de8d8078">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>《推心置腹》 链接：<a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f433c909bc20595e5781e2" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f433c909bc20595e5781e2">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>王OK/洪佩瑜-这条小鱼在乎</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈越龙-nop</span></p><span></span><p><span>Minnz piano-willow</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mr. Machine-Forrest Gump Suite</span></p>]]></description>
