  <item>
    <title>vol.15 《额尔古纳河右岸》迷茫疲惫时回到名为大自然的避风港</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68de98578e321a0d6fba4c8d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68de98578e321a0d6fba4c8d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 02 Oct 2025 15:48:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你好，欢迎打开shownotes。首先祝国庆假期快乐呀！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期分享的是迟子建老师所写的《额尔古纳河右岸》。本起名废不知道起啥名字了，就叫小张啦。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a>鄂温克人的游牧生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a>人就该待在没有屋顶的地方——鄂温克族的帐篷就没有屋顶诶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">04:38</a>狩猎：天上的长生不了，水中的终是虚幻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a>跳神：一只灰色的驯鹿代替她去世了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a>小镜子：像一只看遍了风景和人的眼睛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a>一场双向奔赴的复仇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1296">21:36</a>过度的占有欲滋生的悲剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a>不同的人抄完一整本书的浪漫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">24:27</a>“我还没有尝过被心爱的人舔舐的滋味，我还不能死”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1601">26:41</a> </span></strong><span>“我是雨雪的老熟人了”</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你的收看和收听。祝你早日实现自己想要的自由！</span></p>]]></description>
