  <item>
    <title>vol. 12 春日小诗分享：关于爱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e555238eecdbeb6083ca1f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e555238eecdbeb6083ca1f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Mar 2025 13:42:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你好呀，欢迎打开shownotes,好久不见啊~本期分享四首关于爱的小诗，希望你喜欢！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> 史铁生身残志坚写《我与地坛》；小张我读博摆烂写《我与奥森》。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">2:25</a> 第一首诗：席慕容——《一棵开花的树》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">3:32</a> 在山上，以诗会友的小故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">5:50</a> 第二首诗：舒婷——《致橡树》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">8:14</a> 第三首诗：Roy Craft——《爱》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="701">11:41</a> 第四首诗：Charles Chaplin——《当我开始爱自己》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="936">15:36</a> 相信自己一直在正确的时间正确的地点，做了正确的选择。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1078">17:58</a> 在春天，从逛公园开始爱自己吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢春花-一棵开花的树</span></p><span></span><p><span>Peder B. Helland- Spring</span></p><span></span><p><span>CMJ- 花日</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mr. Machine- Forrest Gump Suite</span></p>]]></description>
