    <guid isPermaLink="false">6686be290bc5d7cc70e1246c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jul 2024 15:22:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> 马可瓦尔多，在城市的底层打工人的生存手账</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="281">4:41</a>春：《烟，风和肥皂泡》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="883">14:43</a>春：《我的拐杖跟随你》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">18:13</a>夏：《一个有着阳光、沙子和睡意的星期六》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a>秋：《顽固猫咪的花园》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a>秋：《自行车后座的猴面包树》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2231">37:11</a>冬：《消失在雪里的城市》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2577">42:57</a>冬：《圣诞老人的孩子》</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿我们能在现实中生活，在想象中浪漫。</span></p>]]></description>
