  <item>
    <title>vol.4 读老舍作品《离婚》：百年前一位小镇做题家的中年危机，与现在的困境并无区别</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665c2d6e94977a26ef9c86f0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665c2d6e94977a26ef9c86f0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Jun 2024 08:29:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>感谢打开本期播客！本期分享的是老舍先生自评，最为满意的作品《离婚》。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a> 主播新名字“笼中鸟”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> “老李的追爱之旅”离婚与围城的相似性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">05:25</a> 故事梗概，人物简介“老李”和“张大哥”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">07:37</a> 故事开始的一顿火锅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="641">10:41</a> 老李对于生命的诗意的追寻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a> 一切恍惚不定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">15:32</a> 老李的自我审视小镇做题家的奋斗史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1445">24:05</a> 风尘女子“苦心与黑暗遇上便是悲剧”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1668">27:48</a> 老李裸辞-读研退学？“愿我们都能冲出自己的金丝笼，找到我们的旷野~”</span></p><span></span><p><span>越好读的小说越难讲。拆开分析怕自己啰嗦，笼统讲解又觉得不够。等以后熟练了，一定要再录一期补上！经典值得反复读~</span></p>]]></description>
